# Misc
# Built setuid helpers — DO NOT commit binaries (arch-specific; setuid root cannot
# be stored safely in git). Source is tracked: run-as-primary.c, ve-refresh-shell.c.
# Install: ./install-ve-refresh-shell.sh [--all]  (also run by setup_agent / fix-perms)
run-as-primary
ve-refresh-shell

